{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_08_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2d6ef78177ee9491c50846307bd95393888dd4e7e64de98ddbf62cbb4a0bab31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ff1d835a4bae6810a6e0d424d4c54e33e8722a5c905f3f6d7bae9a2678ce91",
      "text": "怎么会……这种时候取消！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f68b2e6d52a8d911c0cc05cfddbe95522170857a3b16e98b2a0fd32c666dad1",
      "text": "大家都努力到今天了，为什么会这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0283ea83cb077a2975004b5ca20222ba039515006575a2fc528775d34cfe97d2",
      "text": "……大家都大受打击啊。这也难怪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b666b3b4e3d9f9ff06677e99a4dd683f52f3b2079a99a03cc8a1611e2c4288",
      "text": "我们参赛选手固然难受……\n粉丝们也一定会很失望吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:538fdcc6645ebae7119dcb19a6bef3727ab3f7ff89416b863e2739aa07bea255",
      "text": "……喂，各位！这样办如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473972cb012568c2d5f63306a30e4140825c54d7b40fb00ef33e89c1f1284c7f",
      "text": "虽然这次的“力量部门”取消了，\n但为了直到今天都在刻苦训练的我们自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81ef269dddf2f5a15b276add955ce12cf4de69a95062ce835b47e6eb0f28545e",
      "text": "最重要的是，为了期待着明天的粉丝们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a59c90dd46d9215f0733161d56e37efb55f24ea13424253b69aaae957de95d",
      "text": "先不管男极联赛，\n由我们自己来举办舞台表演怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53cd822fa3442f9302fa3c229d6f16993442334a17de87f5c52b9cc9b07a0583",
      "text": "虽说没有服装和道具，但没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:478d3680413882241d2240e67d5d52319941f76f97408d9c257df76163bd5990",
      "text": "在场的每个人，都有锻炼出来的体魄。\n穿彩排用的训练服就足够了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:095cb0abb9aa4ef82cea7ddcba8a7c49d8fd8dcc91e8405d880baf1e5a5379fb",
      "text": "没错，就算舞台没完工，\n唱歌跳舞还是做得到的……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad56ce5e42f5f6f3f3888d565cfdb2192deef3d852e212e07c847e7652e5fce4",
      "text": "……说不定总会有办法的。\n工作人员，能不能就这么走一步看一步试试？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a20e8ec92f575334ce51ee9219d2ffd45b4e81f0202b1d2079b0e7123a4d580",
      "text": "我们能坚持努力到今天，\n就是为了能看到粉丝们的笑容啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ebd8fa4b1d0b7ecf7487e18337ce399b66675f029187afc710349e48453414d",
      "text": "嗯。就算拿不到“力量部门”的第一名，\n至少也要带着粉丝们的笑容回去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b92aefc227eaf02cbe0ae74a8ce99ef78678eb56c147d989505eafba1de3f3f",
      "text": "……说得对。\n我们也想看粉丝们的笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8d712724a2e0ed6fbb4c5470019398b47e0f4eac95c15d32d27c6ac3991ce1a",
      "text": "没错！看不到粉丝的笑容，\n这身练到现在的力气都没地方使了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ec146703cd6d5370260b0ba55a4f52ee7598ea94bdf4205ebfae5ee0c4632d7",
      "text": "各位……我们也不想\n就这么草草收场，心情是一样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_d:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619168d085d5bc878e64539f3a9a7133402a81e83cd65da47310867437b4d9a1",
      "text": "就算脱离男极，\n我们也会去确认一下能不能想办法把舞台办起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
